Tests ability to design edge-optimized streaming PCA with strict resource limits and actionable, interpretable alerts.

## Key Concepts

- Streaming PCA with randomized SVD
- Incremental imputation for missing data
- Drift detection on loadings for nonstationarity
- On-device latency/memory budgeting
- Interpretability of loadings for governance alerts

## Code Example

